  "historyNote": "#6337, eff 9-25-96 (formerly Saf-C 211.06); ss by #7349, eff 8-22-00; ss by #8230-B, eff 12-17-04; ss by #10395-B, eff 8-15-13; ss by #13938, eff 4-24-24 (formerly Saf-C 212.06) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 7500)",
